{"id":"6dd42dd522c20a30","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md","title":"Saturated Ideal","display":"df-saturated-ideal — Saturated Ideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-saturated-ideal","aliases":["58-df-saturated-ideal"],"display":"df-saturated-ideal — Saturated Ideal","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-saturated-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-saturated-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-saturated-ideal — Saturated Ideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,X,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(I,X,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\)</span> (set-ideal predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S\\)</span> (saturated-ideal predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S(I,X,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\\land \\forall F\\in V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Function}(F,\\lambda,\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus I)\\to \\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\land F(\\alpha)\\cap F(\\beta)\\notin I)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S(I,X,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\\land \\forall F\\in V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Function}(F,\\lambda,\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus I)\\to \\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\land F(\\alpha)\\cap F(\\beta)\\notin I)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-saturation forbids a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-sized family of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-positive sets whose pairwise intersections all lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The assertion that the nonstationary ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_2\">\\(\\omega_2\\)</span>-saturated is not a theorem of ZFC; it is an additional set-theoretic hypothesis with substantial consistency strength.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}$ (set-ideal predicate; see [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate; see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate; see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,X,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S(I,X,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin I\\land \\forall F\\in V\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Function}(F,\\lambda,\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus I)\\to \\exists\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;(\\alpha<\\beta\\land F(\\alpha)\\cap F(\\beta)\\notin I)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_2","display":false}],"bytes":1429,"backlinks":[{"id":"15e4c50c444f9af0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c8145f4209849226","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b575e2b9b2de46cc","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SaturatedIdeal}_S$ (cardinal-indexed saturation predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-saturated-ideal.md|58-df-saturated-ideal]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9","5fb1c2241d1943d1","36d7463d215be751"]}